# Eriette of the Charmed Apple: "Each creature that's enchanted by an Aura you control can't attack you or planeswalkers you control" (CR 508.1c).
# Turn 1: Bot1 casts Eriette. Turn 2: Bot2 enchants its own Ornithopter with its own Holy Strength and casts a Memnite. Turn 3: Bot1 puts
# its Holy Strength on Bot2's Memnite and casts Karn; at Bot1's end step Eriette drains for the one Aura Bot1 controls (Bot2's does not count).
# Turn 4: the Memnite, enchanted by Bot1's Aura, can attack neither Bot1 nor Karn; the Ornithopter, enchanted only by Bot2's Aura, attacks Karn.
